}
CaloraController o-- PlanJobManager
PlanJobManager *-- "0..*" PlanJob
PlanJob --> JobStatus
Thread <|-- ProgressSpinner
CliApp ..> ProgressSpinner : starts / stops
WebApp --> CaloraController : submit and poll
PlanJobManager ..> SqliteDataManager : worker threads write via
ParallelAIProvider o-- "1..*" AIProvider : one worker thread per model
AIProvider <|.. ParallelAIProvider
